    "briefText": "Run gui-improve again on the General settings tab, this time for real: the task text must allow the implement and correct stages to write in public/ and lib/ and to commit on a branch, the compare stage must take its after shots at the same viewports and states the baseline recorded, the review gate must be free to reject with a note, and the change must land by PR with the comparison page showing before, after and diff for every pair, so the improvement is code on main rather than a ledger entry.",
